w is that different than one or two  instances of abuse  we don't really know the answers to  questions like that  and then where should we be only looking  at the brain we know now that the brain  and the body are having conversations  and so  we want to ask questions about that and  finally all of this work  comes together to answer the question  which hopefully many of us will talk  about today  how can we make a difference and help  every child reach their potential  okay great  you

